# Decorum Dissertation aimed at Bot2, which responds with Dawn's Truce (Mox Pearl and Mox Ruby) and has hexproof: its only target is
# illegal, so the spell does not resolve (CR 608.2b). Bot2 draws nothing and loses no life. It is put into the graveyard, not exiled
# (paradigm's "exile this spell" is part of resolving), and since no spell with its name has resolved, no paradigm trigger exists: on turn 5 no copy
# is offered (`! Bot1.Accept`). The positive control is the paradigm scenario where it resolves.

